     "desktop": {
      "rowStart": 12,
      "colStart": 11,
      "rowEnd": 16,
      "colEnd": 24,
      "z": 4,
      "justify": "flex-start",
      "align": "flex-start"
     },
     "vars": {
      "--stroke-style": "none",
      "--stroke-thickness": "6px",
      "--tweak-text-block-radius": "0px 0px 0px 0px",
      "--tweak-text-block-blend": "normal",
      "--blur-value": "blur(15px)"
     },
     "varsMobile": {},
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p class=\"rte-large\" style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\">This initiative was launched to provide support to <em>schools, teachers, and students</em> impacted by wildfires. Led by our dedicated California-based chapter teams, we work through donations and volunteer efforts to <span class=\"rte-text-highlight\"><strong>supply essential classroom resources, deliver emotional support programs, and help rebuild safe learning environments.</strong></span> Our commitment is to support affected communities in their recovery, ensuring that students can continue their education without interruption.</p>"
    },
    {
     "id": "bed3ee93d1cd32550161",
     "mobile": {
      "rowStart": 37,
      "colStart": 2,
      "rowEnd": 42,
      "colEnd": 10,
      "z": 4,
      "justify": "center",
      "align": "center"
     },
     "desktop": {
      "rowStart": 16,
      "colStart": 11,
      "rowEnd": 19,
      "colEnd": 24,
      "z": 5,
      "justify": "flex-start",
      "align": "flex-start"
     },
     "vars": {
      "--stroke-style": "none",
      "--stroke-thickness": "6px",
      "--tweak-text-block-radius": "0px 0px 0px 0px",
      "--tweak-text-block-blend": "normal",
      "--blur-value": "blur(15px)"
     },
     "varsMobile": {},
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"rte-large\">This initiative was led by our EduBud Irvine Chapter, which organized a successful can drive across nearby schools, <strong><em>collecting over 5,000 cans</em></strong> to donate to the <em>Family Forward</em> weekend food pantry. In addition, they <strong><em>raised more than $7,000</em></strong> to support students from families who lost their homes to fires.</p>"
    },
